	acceptable build for our products on Alpha.  Anyone who thinks that
	rebuilding a CAD product is a matter of spending $500 on a new
compiler
	has another thing coming.  Also hindering us is the relatively poor
	support of Alpha from VISIX (now chapter 11).   We will not ship a
	product whose quality we cannot stand behind.  Up to now, Alpha has
	been mostly an irritant and accounts for less than 5% of our sales.
	
