There is no Pass 2 Pyxis.  There was only one rev. of this chip.  There is
however a PAL on the board that implements some logic to fix bugs in the
Pyxis chip.  This PAL has several revisions and I do believe that the later
fixes in the PAL broke some other things (I seem to recall Ensoniq falling
into this category but I'm not sure).  However, if you go to the old code it
may enable some other "features" (bugs) that the new PAL fixes.

In any event, I don't know if Samsung solders down the PAL or sockets it.
But if it is socketed they may be able to provide an "old" PAL that you
could plug in if you would rather have the other bugs and have the Ensoniq
card work.

Aaron

